  "body": "A great opportunity to secure a modern, easy-care home in Stanmore Bay! This three-bedroom property offers a practical layout and comfortable living across two levels,ideal for first-home buyers, young families or investors.\r\n\r\nThe open-plan kitchen, dining and living area opens directly onto a private deck, providing a great space to relax or entertain. The modern kitchen comes with quality appliances and plenty of storage space, making everyday cooking easy.\r\n\r\nA bedroom and separate guest toilet on the ground floor add extra flexibility, while upstairs you'll find two further bedrooms, including the master with its own ensuite, plus a family bathroom.\r\n\r\nStanmore Bay Village, beautiful local beaches and the upcoming Penlink connection are all within easy reach, adding to the convenience of this location.\r\n\r\nWhether you're buying your first home or adding to your investment portfolio, this property is well worth your attention.\r\n\r\nContact us today to arrange a viewing!\r\n\r\nSee interactive features for this property on barfoot.co.nz. Click the \"View office website\" link at the bottom of this page.",
